{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ERJffzAmaEZcX9jMwqvGnz","type":"tool_result","content":"    title: \"A grant_writable answer is recorded, and counts as one more preparation, before config.json is written, so a configuration that cannot be read or written leaves the grant counted and the directory not given\"\n    severity: low\n    priority: p3\n    scope: application\n    what_happened: >\n      `Harness.answerDecision` (`src/application/harness.ts`) commits `decision.answer` and stores the human decision\n      before it calls `ControllerConfigPort.grantWritable`. When `config.json` was made unreadable or invalid after the\n      session started, or cannot be written, `ControllerConfigFile.grantWritable` (`src/extension/config.ts`) throws\n      out of `answerDecision`: the answer stays recorded as `grant_writable`, `preparationsGranted`\n      (`src/application/phases/verification-design.ts`) counts it as one more preparation, and that preparation runs\n      without the directory the owner agreed to give.\n    what_expected: >\n      The owner's answer that gives a control a directory is recorded only once the directory is written into the\n      controller's configuration; when it cannot be written, the answer is refused, naming `config.json` and what is\n      wrong with it, and the question stays pending.\n    steps_to_reproduce:\n      - \"Drive a change to the IH-04 that offers grant_writable (test/v2-kernel/writable-proposal.test.ts), with a data directory holding a valid config.json.\"\n      - \"Before answering, write an unknown key into config.json, or make it read-only.\"\n      - \"Answer grant_writable: answerDecision throws, yet pendingDecisions no longer lists the IH-04 and the next advance spends a third preparation whose frozen unit control does not carry test-output/.\"\n    root_cause: >\n      The write of the configuration is an effect of the answer placed after the answer is committed, with no\n   